cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you mention ShipGuard in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "ShipGuard"
type: software
abstract: "ShipGuard is a command-line release gate for AI-built apps. It checks a project for leaked secrets, unprotected routes, destructive database migrations, unverified payment webhooks and risky deployment settings. It runs locally and your code never leaves your machine."
authors:
  - name: "AgenticCLI"
    website: "https://agenticcli.dev"
